  "project_description": "Provides a user interface for selecting applicable tax rates on the product variation.\n\n By default, Commerce always selects the default tax rate for the resolved tax type and zone. This module provides a \"Tax rate\" field type and matching logic, which allows selecting a reduced rate or no rate, in case of tax free products.\n\n To get started, go to your product variation type, and create a \"Tax rate\" field. Then edit your product variation and select the desired tax rates. The field will be auto-detected by the module's resolver.",
